    "our-story": {
      "type": "our-story",
      "settings": {
        "heading": "OUR STORY",
        "content": "<p>\"pronounced as uh-mee-nu\"</p><p>At Aminu, we bring together the best of science and art to bring you your healthiest skin ever. We draw inspiration from everywhere, from the powerhouse nutrients in superfoods to the fascinating world of microbiology, material sciences, art, and culture. Our journey goes beyond skincare; it's deeply personal. It’s shaped by real experiences and a genuine understanding of what it means to care for your skin in a way that feels balanced and fits into the balance of your life.</p><p><strong>Skincare shouldn’t be complicated, so we’ve simplified it for you. Healthy, radiant skin is just a routine away!</strong></p><p><strong>— Prachi</strong></p>",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/About_AMINU_54a9abe7-ca60-452a-a686-f5f5a2bd8465.webp",
        "button_label": "KNOW MORE",
        "button_link": "shopify://collections/all"
      }
